---

<Layout
  title="Speisekarte | Taco Loco Cantina Mexicana Berlin-Mitte"
  description="Entdecke die Speisekarte von Taco Loco in Berlin-Mitte: Tacos, Burritos, Quesadillas, Enchiladas, Vorspeisen, Beilagen, Salate und Suppen."
  activePage="speisekarte"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="menu-page-header">
    <div class="cantina-container">
      <span class="sticker-badge badge-favorite">🇲🇽 ECHTE MEXIKANISCHE KÜCHE</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">SPEISEKARTE</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        Alle Gerichte werden frisch mit authentischen mexikanischen Zutaten und viel Liebe in unserer Cantina in Berlin-Mitte zubereitet.
      </p>

      <!-- Category Navigation Pills -->
      <div class="cat-nav-pills">
        {categories.map((cat) => (
          <a href={`#${cat.id}`} class="cat-pill">
            <span>{cat.icon}</span>
            <span>{cat.title}</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Menu Content -->
  <main class="menu-sections-wrapper">
    <div class="cantina-container">
      
      {categories.map((cat) => (
        <section class="menu-cat-block" id={cat.id}>
          
          <div class="cat-block-header">
            <div class="cat-title-row">
              <span class="cat-icon-badge">{cat.icon}</span>
              <div>
                <h2 class="cat-block-title">{cat.title}</h2>
                <p class="cat-block-sub">{cat.subtitle}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Dishes Grid -->
          <div class="dishes-editorial-grid">
            {cat.items.map((dish) => (
              <article class="dish-spread-row">
                
                <div class="dish-top-head">
                  <div class="dish-title-box">
                    <span class="dish-nr-badge">#{dish.nr}</span>
                    <h3 class="dish-item-name">{dish.name}</h3>
                    {dish.badge && <span class="sticker-badge badge-new">{dish.badge}</span>}
                  </div>
                  <span class="dish-item-price">{dish.price}</span>
                </div>

                <p class="dish-item-desc">{dish.desc}</p>

                <div class="dish-bottom-meta">
                  {dish.dietary ? (
                    <span class="dietary-label">🌱 {dish.dietary}</span>
                  ) : (
                    <span></span>
                  )}
                  <a 
                    href={GOOGLE_RESERVE_URL}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="reserve-mini-link"
                    aria-label={`${dish.name} probieren - Tisch reservieren`}
                  >
                    <span>TISCH RESERVIEREN →</span>
                  </a>
                </div>

              </article>
            ))}
          </div>

        </section>
      ))}

      <!-- Allergen Note -->
      <div class="allergen-note-open">
        <div class="allergen-heading">
          <span>ℹ️</span>
          <h3>ALLERGENE & BESONDERE WÜNSCHE</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="allergen-main-text">
          Bei Lebensmittelallergien oder Unverträglichkeiten sprich bitte unser Service-Team an. Viele unserer Gerichte können flexibel vegetarisch oder vegan zubereitet werden.
        </p>
        <div class="allergen-cta-row">
          <p>Möchtest du einen Tisch reservieren?</p>
          <a href={GOOGLE_RESERVE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">
            <span>TISCH RESERVIEREN →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .menu-page-header {
    background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
    padding: 4.5rem 0 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--brand-green);
  }

  .page-title {
    color: var(--brand-green);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── Category Anchor Pills ── */
  .cat-nav-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .cat-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--brand-green);
    background-color: #FFFDF3;
    border: 2px solid var(--brand-green);
    padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cat-pill:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background-color: var(--accent-yellow);
    color: var(--brand-green);
  }

  /* ── Menu Section Content ── */
  .menu-sections-wrapper {
    background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
    padding: 4.5rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .menu-cat-block {
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 110px;
  }

  .cat-block-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--brand-green);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cat-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cat-icon-badge {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    background-color: var(--accent-yellow);
    border: var(--border-thick);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #075319;
  }

  .cat-block-title {
    color: var(--brand-green);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.8vw, 2.6rem);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cat-block-sub {
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  /* ── Dishes Grid ── */
  .dishes-editorial-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .dish-spread-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-bottom: var(--border-dashed);
    padding-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .dish-top-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dish-title-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dish-nr-badge {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #FFFDF3;
    background-color: var(--brand-green);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .dish-item-name {
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    color: var(--brand-green);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .dish-item-price {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--energy-red);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .dish-item-desc {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .dish-bottom-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: auto;
